BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:E5954098@UK.endis.com
DTSTART:20261031T100000Z
DTEND:20261031T120000Z
SUMMARY:Women's Creative Club
DESCRIPTION:We invite women in Attleborough and surroundings to join our Creative Club every month on the last Saturday for crafting. Mothers\, daughters and grandmothers are all welcome to learn and make new things or bring their own crafts along. The important thing is to enjoy the morning doing something relaxing (or challenging) and to meet with old friends or make new ones. We provide the materials and refreshments at no cost. Come along\, we'd love to have you!
LOCATION:Church Building
URL:https://www.attleborough.church/Calendar/Month.aspx?show_event=5954098
END:VEVENT
